# Text files are LF in the working tree on every platform. Project files, generated WGSL and
# expectation files are compared byte for byte with what the code writes, and a CRLF checkout
# on Windows made those comparisons fail.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.r8 binary
*.r16 binary
*.r32 binary
*.raw binary
*.exr binary
*.tif binary
*.tiff binary
*.zip binary
